.env
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
output/
deliveries/
quarantine/
media/

# document arm
#
# NOTE: git treats '#' as a comment ONLY at the start of a line. A trailing
# comment becomes part of the pattern, so `*.tokens.json  # keys` matched
# nothing and a re-identification sidecar was committable. Keep comments on
# their own lines.
#
# REAL QR and portrait rasters; the QR decodes to a real identity.
# Harvest your own locally, never commit these.
multimodal/synth/assets/
multimodal/out/
out/
# re-identification keys: map pseudonyms back to real values
*.tokens.json
*.audit.jsonl

# Generated reports, deliverable documents and sample media.
# The repository carries what is needed to RUN the pipeline; evaluation
# numbers, design documents and sample outputs are produced locally and are
# not collaborator-facing.
results/
outputs/
# no data of any kind in the repository, redacted or not (owner decision 2026-10-02)
sample/
docs/screenshots/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UNREDACTED SOURCE MATERIAL MUST NEVER BE COMMITTED.
#
# Directory rules alone were not enough: `output/`, `deliveries/`, `quarantine/`
# and `media/` were covered, but `result/` was not -- and run_all.py writes
# result/dedupe/unique/, which holds the ORIGINAL audio, plus fingerprints
# derived from it. Nor did anything stop a corpus being copied into the tree
# under any other name.
#
# So media is ignored BY EXTENSION, everywhere. A folder of calls dropped
# anywhere in this repo is ignored whatever it is called.
*.mp3
*.wav
*.flac
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.opus
*.aac
*.wma
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm

# ...except the watermark clips, which are part of the tool, not data.
!prompts/watermark/*.wav

# run_all.py's dataset output: summary, dedupe fingerprints, unique reps.
result/

# Working artifacts that hold UNREDACTED text wherever they appear.
transcript.json
intervals.json
rendered_intervals.json
prepare.json

# compiled Apple Vision helper; built from vision_helper.swift on first use
multimodal/document_pipeline/vision_helper.bin
multimodal/document_pipeline/vision_helper.bin.*
